      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The prediction applies under simultaneous abrasive and oxidative/corrosive exposure at moderate to elevated temperatures, but may fail when TiB2 is nonuniform or the passive film is chemically unstable.",
